      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:03.20",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3200,
      "text": "Low-angle shot framing the towering stone archway as a stern Police Constable steps through the heavy open doors, blocking Lord Sterling's path.",
      "line_number": 14,
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B002",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 1,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:03.20",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3200,
      "text": "The Police Constable strides firmly down the steps and halts right in front of Lord Sterling, holding his ground.",
      "line_number": 18,
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B003",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 2,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:03.20",
      "end_raw": "00:08.60",
      "start_ms": 3200,
      "end_ms": 8600,
      "text": "Medium two-shot of the Police Constable towering over Lord Sterling.",
      "line_number": 22,
      "duration_ms": 5400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B004",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 3,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "POLICE CONSTABLE (Authoritative, Stern)",
      "speaker": "POLICE CONSTABLE",
      "delivery": [
        "Authoritative",
        "Stern"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:03.30",
      "end_raw": "00:08.20",
      "start_ms": 3300,
      "end_ms": 8200,
      "text": "\"Lord Henry Sterling, you are under arrest by order of the Crown.\"",
      "line_number": 26,
      "duration_ms": 4900
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B005",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 4,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:08.60",
      "end_raw": "00:11.40",
      "start_ms": 8600,
      "end_ms": 11400,
      "text": "Close-up on Lord Sterling's trembling, indignant face.",
      "line_number": 30,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B006",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 5,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "LORD STERLING (Snarls, Outraged)",
      "speaker": "LORD STERLING",
      "delivery": [
        "Snarls",
        "Outraged"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:09.10",
      "end_raw": "00:11.20",
      "start_ms": 9100,
      "end_ms": 11200,
      "text": "\"You have no authority!\"",
      "line_number": 34,
      "duration_ms": 2100
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B007",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 6,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:11.40",
      "end_raw": "00:13.80",
      "start_ms": 11400,
      "end_ms": 13800,
      "text": "Close-up on the Constable's black-gloved hands holding out a thick, red-ribboned dossier stamped with the Crown's royal wax seal.",
      "line_number": 38,
      "duration_ms": 2400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B008",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 7,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "POLICE CONSTABLE (Cold, Definite)",
      "speaker": "POLICE CONSTABLE",
      "delivery": [
        "Cold",
        "Definite"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:11.40",
      "end_raw": "00:13.20",
      "start_ms": 11400,
      "end_ms": 13200,
      "text": "\"I have more than enough.\"",
      "line_number": 42,
      "duration_ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B009",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 8,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:13.80",
      "end_raw": "00:16.40",
      "start_ms": 13800,
      "end_ms": 16400,
      "text": "Wide shot of the ruined nave littered with rubble as royal redcoat guards surround the aisle, forcing Rupert down onto his knees.",
      "line_number": 53,
      "duration_ms": 2600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B010",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 9,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:14.00",
      "end_raw": "00:16.40",
      "start_ms": 14000,
      "end_ms": 16400,
      "text": "A royal redcoat guard firmly forces Rupert down into the stone dust.",
      "line_number": 57,
      "duration_ms": 2400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B011",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 10,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Frantic, Shouting)",
      "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Frantic",
        "Shouting"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:14.00",
      "end_raw": "00:16.80",
      "start_ms": 14000,
      "end_ms": 16800,
      "text": "\"Get your hands off me! Catherine!\"",
      "line_number": 61,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B012",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 11,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:16.40",
      "end_raw": "00:19.40",
      "start_ms": 16400,
      "end_ms": 19400,
      "text": "Close-up on Rupert struggling fiercely against the white-gloved grip of the guard pinning his shoulder.",
      "line_number": 65,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B013",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 12,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Desperate, Screaming)",
      "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Desperate",
        "Screaming"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:17.40",
      "end_raw": "00:19.30",
      "start_ms": 17400,
      "end_ms": 19300,
      "text": "\"Do something!\"",
      "line_number": 69,
      "duration_ms": 1900
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B014",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 13,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:19.40",
      "end_raw": "00:22.00",
      "start_ms": 19400,
      "end_ms": 22000,
      "text": "Medium close-up on Catherine beneath her bridal veil, looking downward in conflicted silence.",
      "line_number": 73,
      "duration_ms": 2600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B015",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 14,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:21.80",
      "end_raw": "00:24.40",
      "start_ms": 21800,
      "end_ms": 24400,
      "text": "Catherine's satin-gloved hand clenches tightly into a trembling fist against the folds of her ornate gown.",
      "line_number": 77,
      "duration_ms": 2600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B016",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 15,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:22.00",
      "end_raw": "00:24.40",
      "start_ms": 22000,
      "end_ms": 24400,
      "text": "Close-up on Catherine's gloved hand tightening into a fist.",
      "line_number": 81,
      "duration_ms": 2400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B017",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 16,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:24.40",
      "end_raw": "00:27.80",
      "start_ms": 24400,
      "end_ms": 27800,
      "text": "Wide shot as Catherine gathers her heavy train and steps away from Rupert, walking toward Alexander who stands watching her stoically.",
      "line_number": 85,
      "duration_ms": 3400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B018",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 17,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Shaken, Tearful)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Shaken",
        "Tearful"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:25.20",
      "end_raw": "00:28.00",
      "start_ms": 25200,
      "end_ms": 28000,
      "text": "\"Alexander... I thought you had died.\"",
      "line_number": 89,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B019",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 18,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:27.80",
      "end_raw": "00:31.20",
      "start_ms": 27800,
      "end_ms": 31200,
      "text": "Close-up on Catherine's face, tears glistening in her eyes as grief breaks through her composure.",
      "line_number": 93,
      "duration_ms": 3400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B020",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 19,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Choked, Weeping)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Choked",
        "Weeping"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:28.40",
      "end_raw": "00:31.00",
      "start_ms": 28400,
      "end_ms": 31000,
      "text": "\"Do you know what this did to me?\"",
      "line_number": 97,
      "duration_ms": 2600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B021",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 20,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:31.20",
      "end_raw": "00:32.40",
      "start_ms": 31200,
      "end_ms": 32400,
      "text": "Medium shot on Alexander standing tall in his ducal coat, his gaze utterly detached.",
      "line_number": 101,
      "duration_ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B022",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 21,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (O.S.) (Pleading)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Pleading"
      ],
      "offscreen": "O.S.",
      "start_raw": "00:31.20",
      "end_raw": "00:32.40",
      "start_ms": 31200,
      "end_ms": 32400,
      "text": "\"I mourned you.\"",
      "line_number": 105,
      "duration_ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B023",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 22,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:32.40",
      "end_raw": "00:34.00",
      "start_ms": 32400,
      "end_ms": 34000,
      "text": "Profile close-up of Catherine as a tear slips down her cheek.",
      "line_number": 109,
      "duration_ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B024",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 23,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Vulnerable, Trembling)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Vulnerable",
        "Trembling"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:32.40",
      "end_raw": "00:34.00",
      "start_ms": 32400,
      "end_ms": 34000,
      "text": "\"I waited for you.\"",
      "line_number": 113,
      "duration_ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B025",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 24,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:34.00",
      "end_raw": "00:35.80",
      "start_ms": 34000,
      "end_ms": 35800,
      "text": "Medium shot of Catherine standing in the center of the aisle before the seated congregation.",
      "line_number": 117,
      "duration_ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B026",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 25,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Heartbroken)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Heartbroken"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:34.20",
      "end_raw": "00:38.80",
      "start_ms": 34200,
      "end_ms": 38800,
      "text": "\"For three years, I believed the man I loved was buried somewhere across the sea.\"",
      "line_number": 121,
      "duration_ms": 4600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B027",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 26,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:35.80",
      "end_raw": "00:38.80",
      "start_ms": 35800,
      "end_ms": 38800,
      "text": "Tracking two-shot over Alexander's shoulder as Catherine approaches him pleadingly.",
      "line_number": 125,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B028",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 27,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:38.80",
      "end_raw": "00:41.20",
      "start_ms": 38800,
      "end_ms": 41200,
      "text": "Close profile two-shot as Catherine gently reaches her gloved hand up to Alexander's bearded cheek.",
      "line_number": 129,
      "duration_ms": 2400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B029",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 28,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Whispering, Longing)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Whispering",
        "Longing"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:38.90",
      "end_raw": "00:41.20",
      "start_ms": 38900,
      "end_ms": 41200,
      "text": "\"I never stopped loving you.\"",
      "line_number": 133,
      "duration_ms": 2300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B030",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 29,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:41.20",
      "end_raw": "00:42.80",
      "start_ms": 41200,
      "end_ms": 42800,
      "text": "Alexander abruptly pulls his face back, refusing her touch and leaving her hand suspended in mid-air.",
      "line_number": 137,
      "duration_ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B031",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 30,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:41.20",
      "end_raw": "00:42.80",
      "start_ms": 41200,
      "end_ms": 42800,
      "text": "Close-up on Catherine's empty gloved hand trembling in the empty space between them.",
      "line_number": 141,
      "duration_ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B032",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 31,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:42.80",
      "end_raw": "00:46.40",
      "start_ms": 42800,
      "end_ms": 46400,
      "text": "Close-up on Catherine lowering her hand, stunned and deeply hurt by his rejection.",
      "line_number": 145,
      "duration_ms": 3600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP044_B033",
      "episode_id": "EP044",
      "file_index": 32,
      "scene_id": "EP044_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Breathless, Hurt)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
